# asdf / mise toolchain pins.
#
# These are not cosmetic: the class hash a contract compiles to is a function
# of the compiler version. Building the same source with a different Scarb
# produces a different class hash, which means a "redeploy" silently becomes a
# new class rather than the one already audited and referenced on chain.
#
# scarb 2.11.4 matches `starknet = "2.11.4"` in Scarb.toml.
# starknet-foundry 0.53.0 matches the snforge_std_deprecated tag in Scarb.lock.
scarb 2.11.4
starknet-foundry 0.53.0
